================================================================================
Third-party components
================================================================================

GLX is distributed in binary form (for example, the `glx` release archives)
with the following third-party Go components statically linked in. This list
covers the modules compiled into the distributed binary, as reported by
`go version -m`; test-only dependencies that are not incorporated into the
distributed artifacts (e.g. github.com/stretchr/testify) are omitted. Each
component's full license text is available in its respective source repository.

